{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18952","headline":"文宗元圣昭献孝皇帝挽歌三首 二 · 刘禹锡","name":"文宗元圣昭献孝皇帝挽歌三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月落宫车动，风凄仪杖闲。\n路唯瞻凤翣，人尚想龙颜。\n御宇方无事，乘云遂不还。\n圣情悲望处，沈日下西山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}